          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">Can I switch plans later?</button></h2><div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Absolutely. You can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. Upgrades take effect immediately, and downgrades take effect at the next billing cycle. Your data is always preserved.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">What payment methods are accepted?</button></h2><div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">We accept UPI, net banking, credit/debit cards, and bank transfer. All payments are processed securely through Razorpay.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">Is my data safe?</button></h2><div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. We use bank-grade AES-256 encryption for all data. Daily automatic backups are stored on secure cloud servers in India. Your data is never sold or shared with third parties.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq5">Is there a long-term contract?</button></h2><div id="faq5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">No. BoviNetra is month-to-month with no long-term commitment. Annual plans offer 20% savings but are also cancellable with a pro-rated refund for unused months.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq6">Does BoviNetra work offline?</button></h2><div id="faq6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"><div class="accordion-body">Yes! The mobile app works fully offline. You can record milk, update cattle records, and manage payments without internet. Data syncs automatically when connectivity is restored.</div></div></div>
